{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Umra bhar [Em]ki tu talash hai,        [Am]Zindagi [Em]tu hai to khas hai
[Dm]Tu hai to khwabon jaise [G]din,        Tu hai to [Em]raat afsana
[Dm]Ke har lamha karu [G]hasske,        Mere rab ka main [Em]shukrana
[Am]Tu hai humdum, hardum hai [G]jaana,        [F]Mere dil ka mere dil ka
[Am]Tu humdum, humdum hai [G]jaana,        [F]Mere dil ka mere dil ka
[Dm]Tu mehram mehram hai [G]jaana,        Mere dil ka mere [Em]dil ka
[Am]Tu humdum, hardum hai [G]jaana,        [F]Mere dil ka mere dil ka
[Am]Kuch to hua hai aisa,        Haske dhadkati hai [Em]dhadkan [Dm]aaj kal
[Am]Lagta hai jaadu koi,        Tune hi kiya ho jaise [Em]muzpe [Dm]aajkal
[Dm]Ujaalo si [G]khubsurat,        [Em]hasi ko [Am]choom lo
[Dm]Khayalon ki sab [G]baatein,        [Dm]paas aake [Em]bol du
[Am]Rahe jo ik jaisa hardum [G]ho,        Hasi mausam tu [Em]ban jaana
[Am]Ke har lamha karu [G]hasske,        Main apne rab ka [Em]main shukrana
[Am]Tu humdum, hardum hai [G]jaana,        [F]Mere dil ka mere dil ka
